.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm mbt_storage
library provides interfaces for different storage backends to persist or manage torrent pieces.
It defines a standard
.Vt mbt_storage_ops
structure that all backends must implement, allowing the library to interact with file-based or memory-based storage polymorphically.
.Sh FILE STORAGE
The file-based backend implements storage on the local filesystem.
For this backend, the
.Vt ctx
pointer is expected to be a null-terminated string containing the path to the output file.
